PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已接续并完成一轮可复核维护。\n\n## 复现的缺口\n\n在拒收候选 `77acf02` 上，用封存的 case-1/case-2 owner 状态和真实 prepared-review 提交重放固定执行器（`pulse → git merge --ff-only → stop`）：\n\n- 投递守护**确实**追加了 DELIVER 结论；\n- 但该结论改写了 principal 的 statement，把所有 artifact 重新记到新 HEAD，并给新 artifact 写了非规范 `detail`；\n- 因此按规范 `committed at HEAD` 读取交付记录的消费者得到 `delivered:true, recorded:[]`。\n\n新增的密封回放 oracle 在 `77acf02` 上精确复现该形状，并失败 14/26 项。\n\n## 改进\n\n提交 `21a5a5a` — *Keep a refreshed delivery readable as the principal's record*\n\n- `src/deployment/direct_delivery_guard.ts`\n  - 原样保留 principal statement（仅移除旧版守护自己追加的 suffix）；\n  - 新记录的字节保留规范 `detail: \"committed at HEAD\"`；\n  - 未变化的 artifact 保留其原始交付 commit，并标记为 carried；\n  - 刷新来源写入显式 `check.refresh` 和 `guard:direct-delivery@<head>` evidence ref。\n- `src/project_continuity/episode.ts`\n  - 增加 additive `EpisodeProvenanceRefresh` 类型；\n  - journal 正文显式渲染 provenance refresh，不再依赖改写 statement。\n- `test/pnwf_direct_guard.test.ts` 与相关 oracle 更新为检查真实刷新元数据。\n- 新增 `scripts/pnwf/software/self-maintenance-delivery-record.mjs`。\n\n## 验证\n\n- 新 oracle：当前 `26/26`；`77acf02` 上 `delivered:true, recorded:[]`，14 项失败。\n- 11 个维护 oracle 全部通过。\n- 6 个相关测试套件 `67/67` 通过。\n- `tsc -b` 与 public-API baseline 通过。\n- 全量套件仍有 98 项与环境/既有基线相关的失败（缺少 `examples/`、`docs/`、`research-evidence/`、python、进程树时序，以及 `install_contract.ts` 既有 hotspot ratchet），不属于本次改动路径。\n\n## 记录与边界\n\n- conclusion：`episode-76091feafd49ce73953888fe`，当前状态 `DELIVERED`，`mayEnd=true`。\n- 直接交付提交：`21a5a5a`；canonical ProjectIR head 仍是 `082f77a`，未推进。\n- 这是 advisory direct delivery，不构成 operator acceptance、promotion 或发布授权；operator 仍保留接受与 canonical-head 决定权。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:palimpsest_work","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/re